<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo sets 200 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo sets 200 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY  **27.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    04.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAM	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 27.JAN.97 THEN STEJPS UP TO 4.70 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALL AT PAR ON 27.JAN.97</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 950</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
